~ start
if QuestService.is_completed_offered()
	=> completed
elif QuestService.is_ready_offered()
	=> ready
elif QuestService.is_accepted_offered()
	=> in_progress
else
	Elder: Traveler, the village needs your help.
	Elder: Slimes have overrun the pond. Bring me one slime gel and I will see you rewarded.
	- I will hunt the slimes.
		do QuestService.request_accept_offered()
		Elder: Then go, and return with the gel.
		=> END
	- Not now.
		Elder: Come back when you are ready.
		=> END

~ in_progress
Elder: The slimes still trouble the pond. Bring me one slime gel.
=> END

~ ready
Elder: You have the gel. I can take it now and see you rewarded.
- Turn in the slime gel.
	do QuestService.request_turn_in_offered()
	Elder: The village owes you its thanks.
	=> END
- Not yet.
	Elder: Return when you are ready.
	=> END

~ completed
Elder: The village is safer thanks to you. We will not forget this.
=> END
